  "title": "Easy Spaghetti with Tomato Sauce",
  "description": "This meaty tomato sauce for spaghetti is easy to prepare with ground beef, tomatoes, mushrooms, and herbs for a rich and pleasing taste.",
  "authors": [
    "Sammye"
  ],
